{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有。Y的S13把“明知谁也没法答应永远”改成“可就算听到了”，削弱了原本的心理矛盾；S07、S12也有少量把人物动机进一步解释成互相依靠、让对方安心的增义。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的重点放大和感受缩小，让我扫屏时能先抓住人物此刻最重要的念头，再通过感受理解音乐如何推动情绪，而且分时出现的提示减少了一次性阅读负担。人物的心理动机、犹豫和情绪转折也更容易被注意到，感受描写比X具体、细腻，并且与音乐进程结合得更紧。X的优势是叙事因果更完整、前后心理逻辑更稳，尤其S13保留了人物明知永远无法保证却仍想得到保证的矛盾；但综合实际观看体验，我更愿意选Y。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "e6046e93-2ffb-4776-815f-482a9e6d925a", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T231507868301Z", "elapsed_seconds": 67.641, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T23:16:15.534903+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "af4d7cc14ccaa25f431a13e57ef7454751c90de62d66a282a7f091cafb34b183", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f